{"version":1,"content":"<p>視帝陳展鵬於《玫瑰戰爭》內扮演富二代，與傅嘉莉及陳楨怡展開三角關係，傅嘉莉今日（15日）於活動上示範被「大伯父」潘志文無痛掌摑成焦點。</p><p>事後3人受訪，展鵬對戲中「艷福無邊」直言現實生活中無福消受：「千祈唔好咁，好攰㗎，冇能力處理，一個就夠。</p><p>（</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.200998+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:35:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:33.418292+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:33.418292+00:00","content_hash":"d9236718b53d50d2da4d693e811ded2ee7cb78d58491da28c76c63a25fc3e5c3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}